    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1763">

                <pb facs="1150" n="1034" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1034"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.77/204.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Minister Price.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 15, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Discreetly inform Panaman Government that Department’s approval of loan based on
                    hypothecation of income of six million dollars permanently invested in New York,
                    was based on the understanding that this money would be used only for building
                    railroads in Province of Chiriquí.</p>
                <p>Continue to keep Department fully informed and report by cable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
